# Scenario 11 (bug reproduction): File > Export as PDF on a Markdown tab
# before any PDF was opened in the session. Expected: a PDF is written.
# Observed (2026-10-17, PDFium ON): SIGSEGV in PDFium (GetStockCS via
# FPDFPageObj_CreateNewRect) on the export worker - PdfiumEngine::
# buildDocument never initializes the library (only openDocument does).
# The process dies, so the "done" line is never logged.
resize 1280 850
open ${QA_FIX}/edit.md
answer save ${QA_WORK}/11-export.pdf
cmd File/Export as PDF…
log-state
log export finished without crashing
quit
